WEBVTT

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:02.863
And it was during those five days

00:02:02.887 --> 00:02:07.603
that I just realized how lonely
the last couple of years had been.

00:02:09.050 --> 00:02:11.786
Our relationships are what
catch us when we fall down,

00:02:11.810 --> 00:02:14.751
and I realized in that moment,
lying on my couch,

00:02:14.775 --> 00:02:16.988
that I didn't have much of a net.

00:02:21.940 --> 00:02:24.606
Adam Grant: A lot of us are
feeling lonely these days.

00:02:24.630 --> 00:02:28.085
The details in Vivek Murthy's story
might not be the same as yours,

00:02:28.109 --> 00:02:31.506
but you know what it's like to feel
disconnected from your colleagues,